 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/xz/xz.1 b/src/xz/xz.1
index 6e37b42..2249f56 100644
--- a/src/xz/xz.1
+++ b/src/xz/xz.1
@@ -775,7 +775,7 @@ The following table summarises the features of the presets:
 .PP
 .TS
 tab(;);
-c c c c c
+c c c c l
 n n n n n.
 Preset;DictSize;CompCPU;CompMem;DecMem
 \-0;256 KiB;0;3 MiB;1 MiB
@@ -863,7 +863,7 @@ That way no two presets are identical.
 .PP
 .TS
