-c c c c c
+c c c c l
 n n n n n.
 Preset;DictSize;CompCPU;CompMem;DecMem
 \-0e;256 KiB;8;4 MiB;1 MiB
@@ -2688,7 +2688,7 @@ Dictionary size is roughly equal to the decompressor memory usage.
 .PP
 .TS
